{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMING SOON PILL
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Small "More coming soon" pill shown on a product card when every variant is sold out. The card also swaps its add to cart
button for a greyed-out one. Wrap the call in its own row so the card layout can order it above the price row:

{% unless product.available %}<div class="coming-soon-row">{% render 'coming-soon-pill' %}</div>{% endunless %}
{%- endcomment -%}

<span class="coming-soon-pill">{{- 'product.general.more_coming_soon' | t -}}</span>
